@xref rm               Remove — shares undo-record discipline.
@xref undo             Undo replay — walks the PdxFS undo graph.
@xref doc              This tool renders this document.
@xref query            Consumes CopyProgressRecord[] on stdin.
@xref libpdx-audit     Provides audit_begin / audit_commit.
@xref libpdx-elevate   Provides the cross-subtree cap-widening hop.
@xref libpdx-cap       Signed-inode preservation is hand-rolled in
